## Capability vision: openai-compatible, service aphrody-managed-llama, basePath /v1
# Operations: /chat/completions
# APHRODY_AI_VISION_BASE_URL: url, base form.
# vps: unavailable, no local VLM on vps; ai-http /vision/structured forwards to the configured backend.
